<title>BRAZIL: Brazil April 25 coffee regs 3.20 mln bags to June.</title>
<headline>Brazil April 25 coffee regs 3.20 mln bags to June.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil coffee export registrations as of April 25 totaled 3.20 million bags for April, May and June, according to the May 6 bulletin of Rio de Janeiro Coffee Center.</p>
<p>A breakdown by month was as follows.</p>
<p> MONTH     REGISTRATIONS IN 60-KG BAGS</p>
<p> April		  1,469,871</p>
<p> May		    1,394,461</p>
<p> June		     338,872</p>
<p> TOTAL		  3,203,204</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
